From: mscharged-port
Subject: Admit the original gameplay-options cheats list
Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on the Domination setup admission.

The gameplay options page that the authored VS transition pushes (27) has a
second CHEATS view whose three category buttons are always enabled; each press
pushes the original cheat list (28) with its category. A fresh save reaches it
from Main Menu -> VS -> Options -> next page, so the gated factory case stopped
the frontend there.

Under the existing MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_DOMINATION admission, move case
28 into the admitted set. SHOptionsCheatsList keeps its original unlock queries
(IsEnvironment/Powerup/PlayerCheatUnlocked), locked texts and apply path; its
pointer-button index arrives in the callback context word and is narrowed
through std::uintptr_t natively. Console builds keep the literal casts.

